            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==WAL== is written before data pages; commit = log flushed",
                "Analysis, then Redo (**repeat all history**), then Undo (roll back losers, write ==CLRs==)",
                "Buffer policy: ==steal + no-force=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. High Availability",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
